@page
@model RuralBankWeb.Pages.SuccessStoriesModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Success Stories";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">Success Stories</div>
        <h3>Empowering Local Entrepreneurs: The Story of Diosdado S. Jamero III</h3>
        <p style="max-width:640px;">Discover how fast approval and dedicated financial support helped transform an ambitious vision into a flourishing poultry enterprise.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">Watch &amp; Learn</div>
        <h3>See the Impact in Action</h3>
        <p style="max-width:640px;">Hear directly from the farmers and families we've worked with across South Cotabato.</p>

        <div style="max-width:800px; margin-top:40px;">
            <div class="card video-card">
                <video controls preload="metadata" poster="/img/success_story.jpeg">
                    <source src="/video/success_story.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
                    Your browser does not support the video tag.
                </video>
                <h3>Success Stories</h3>
                <p class="video-caption">Meet the real families and business owners across our community who have grown alongside Katagumpay Rural Bank.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">Overview</div>
        <h3>From Vision to Poultry Enterprise</h3>
        <p style="max-width:640px;">When Diosdado S. Jamero III identified a prime business opportunity in poultry farming, he had the experience and a suitable location ready. However, launching a facility sized for 5,000 heads required significant capital investment—a major hurdle for starting up quickly.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">The Challenge</div>
        <h3>Overcoming Capital &amp; Time Constraints</h3>

        <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:30px;">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>High Startup Capital</h3>
                <p>Procuring initial quotations for a 5,000-head poultry capacity required capital beyond immediate resources.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Race Against Time</h3>
                <p>For an eager entrepreneur, delayed financing meant lost momentum and delayed execution.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">The Solution</div>
        <h3>Partnering with Rural Bank of Norala (RBN)</h3>
        <p style="max-width:640px;">Introduced to RBN Norala through an integrator, Diosdado found a financial partner aligned with his urgency and vision:</p>

        <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top:30px;">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Fast Loan Approval</h3>
                <p>The entire approval process—including site inspection and evaluation—was completed in less than 2 weeks.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Streamlined Process</h3>
                <p>Achievable requirements tailored to business owners, making loan securing hassle-free.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Supportive Service</h3>
                <p>Direct, accessible support that kept operations moving smoothly without complicated red tape.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">The Impact &amp; Key Results</div>
        <h3>Sustained Growth Since Day One</h3>

        <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top:30px;">
            <div class="card" style="text-align:center;">
                <div style="font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:2rem; color:var(--color-forest);">4+</div>
                <p>Years of continuous growth—the poultry farm has been thriving and operational for over 4 years.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Effective Capital Utilization</h3>
                <p>The loan capital was directly channeled into establishing and expanding the core poultry facility.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Business Confidence</h3>
                <p>Timely support allowed Diosdado to focus on scaling and managing daily operations efficiently.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">Key Takeaway</div>
        <div class="card story-card" style="max-width:720px; margin:30px auto 0;">
            <div class="story-quote-mark">"</div>
            <p class="story-quote">Be emotionally and physically ready for entrepreneurship—and with the assistance of RBN Norala, managing and growing your business becomes much easier.</p>
            <div class="story-person">
                <strong>Diosdado S. Jamero III</strong>
                <span>Poultry Farm Owner</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
        <div class="divider" style="margin-inline:auto;">Share Your Story</div>
        <h3>Have You Grown with Us?</h3>
        <p style="max-width:560px; margin-inline:auto;">We'd love to feature your journey. If Katagumpay Rural Bank has helped your farm, family, or business grow, tell us about it.</p>
        <a href="/Contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:20px;">Share Your Story</a>
    </div>
</section>